#describe after isPrimaryTap is in pointer.ts, and the helper skips strings, templates and comments; a right-click on a node is tested to change nothing.
#describe verified Typecheck, lint, unit tests and the graph e2e pass, apart from two visual snapshot specs that also fail on main on this machine.
