#reason src/renderer/lib/lantern-pixi/pointer.ts Gives the primary-button check its own small module so graphics files stop importing it from the open-button code.
#reason test/docs-cname.test.ts Keeps a light guard on the file that decides the docs domain after the copy-text tests were removed.
#reason test/source-blocks.test.ts Proves the block finder ignores brackets in literals and comments and still reports an unbalanced block.
#reason docs/primitives.md Names the source-block and Overview-drawer helpers so the next change reuses them instead of writing its own.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lantern-pixi/index.ts Imports the primary-tap check from the pointer module now that it lives there.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lantern-pixi/node-graphics.ts Imports the primary-tap check from the pointer module now that it lives there.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lantern-pixi/open-actions.ts Drops the helper it only borrowed to others and imports it from the pointer module like everyone else.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lantern-pixi/relation-graphics.ts Imports the primary-tap check from the pointer module now that it lives there.
#reason test/e2e/graph-navigation.spec.ts Pins that a right-click on a node changes neither selection nor layout, so removing the primary-tap guard fails a test.
#reason test/helpers/source-blocks.ts Stops a brace inside a string, template or comment from unbalancing the block that wiring tests slice out.
#reason test/install-skills.test.ts Removes a redundant alias of the skill name list that the reviewer flagged.
